{
 "_readme": [
  "What install/install_components.py (and, under 'tools', install/bootstrap.ps1) installs. Every download is pinned: ComfyUI and the node",
  "packs by git commit, weights and tools by size and sha256 (for weights, my own copies, or the served file where I have",
  "none). 'manual' files are never downloaded: MiniMax H3 (its license) and RealVisXL (no public",
  "copy I could check). 'derive' files are made locally from another file. A venv's size_gb is",
  "what that venv took in a fresh install (10^9 bytes, measured 2026-10-25; the qwen venv on cu130 2026-10-27). A venv's",
  "'fallback' is the build it gets on a card or driver that cannot run its 'cuda' build but can run the fallback's."
 ],
